Bocker links the Incus Go client library (github.com/lxc/incus/v7) and embeds
the Zabbly container-only build of the Incus daemon and liblxc runtime. Incus
is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The bundled runtime also contains
third-party libraries distributed by the upstream Incus package; their source
and license information are available from https://github.com/lxc/incus and
https://pkgs.zabbly.com/incus/stable/.
